#
# The image build context is the project root, but the image needs exactly two files: the launcher and
# one JAR. Everything else — .git, the rest of target/, the test rig — is excluded, so the context stays
# small and a stale build artefact cannot end up in the image by accident.
*
!bin
!target/midgie.jar
!midgie-*.jar
